{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"99e3ff61-dda8-43ae-b89b-461c6fb163cd","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events from [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented on the registration and offers screens using [`Analytics.capture`](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/lib/analytics.dart#L13-L14). The detailed documentation of changes and the applicability of the colleague's note have been recorded in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[`RegistrationScreen`](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Captured on initial text input in the email field using a `_emailStartedFired` guard to prevent sending an event per keystroke.\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Captured on initial text input in the phone field using a `_phoneStartedFired` guard.\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Captured via `Slider.onChangeEnd` so it emits only when the user finishes dragging, passing `{'amount': v.round()}`.\n   - `terms_accepted`: Captured in `CheckboxListTile.onChanged` when checked is `true`.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Captured on Continue button press, passing `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n\n2. **[`OfferScreen`](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Captured by wrapping the list with `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e`, passing `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` only once per scroll completion.\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-oADG7y/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Documented all implemented events and detailed which parts of the colleague's note applied (once-per-visit flags for text fields, `onChangeEnd` for sliders, `ScrollEndNotification` for scrolls) and which did not (focus/blur handlers, debouncing, cross-step state retention).\n","duration_seconds":82.272865,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":232537,"output_tokens":4507,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":97148,"total_tokens":237044}}}
